## ZolikaPatch

The feature set, INI keys, defaults, signatures and machine-level behaviour are
those of ZolikaPatch by Zolika1351. ZolikaPatch was distributed as a compiled
ASI without source. This repository contains a clean-room reconstruction and a
readable rewrite of that binary, not the original source.

